    "source": "Unbound - Recipe Examples.pdf, Unbound - Crafting Rules.pdf",
    "notes": [
      "Recipes are organized by era, then by crafting skill.",
      "crafting_dc: roll 1d6 × skill_level vs this DC. Success = total − DC (added as bonus HP to item).",
      "skill_level_required: minimum level in the listed skill to attempt this recipe.",
      "functional_material: the material whose stats (hardness, density, ductility) drive item stat calculations.",
      "critical_success_effect: bonus applied when roll exceeds DC by 10+.",
      "materials: list of { id, qty, unit } — id matches keys in ProcessedMaterials.json or Gatherables.json.",
      "output: what the character receives on success.",
      "item tiers: common=DC4, uncommon=DC6, rare=DC8, epic=DC10, legendary=DC12+"
    ]
